  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved labour administration, social protection, wages systems and workplace compliance policies in Palau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the 2024-2025 biennium, the ILO is supporting the government of Palau on conducting a Gap Analysis to identify potential gaps and challenges preventing ratification of C029 (Convention on Forced Labour) and P29 (Protocol of 2014 to the Forced Labour Convention). The analyses will cover all laws, policies, and institutional capacities to prevent forced labor, to protect and provide assistance to victims, and to ensure their access to justice and remedies. The analysis will assist in the development of policy recommendations and contribute to Palau&#x2019;s efforts to combat human trafficking nationally and in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
